Z||000009||fierohoho||08-28-2001||10:30 PM||||Oh, I totally forgot about the reason for this thread, sorry.<P>My ex-wife is a radio DJ and at the time she was working part time for K102 FM a country station here in Mpls/St Paul. <P>We went to the station Christmas party and at the time our great Governor Jesse Ventura was a talk show host on the AM sister station.<P>I walked over to where several guys were talking to him, seemed like a nice guy, this was just after Predator came out so we were asking him questions about the movie and Arnold. <P>My wife walked up and I didn't notice it at the time but she walked away a couple minutes later, when I found her I asked her why she left and when she told me my lightbulb went on, after she walked up Jesse "ThePerv" Ventura didn't look at anyone in the group but just stared at my ex's chest,(yes it was nice but...)so I didn't really talk to him any more that night, the ex-wife wouldn't go near him either.<P>I did see him once before that at a council meeting when he was Mayor of BrooklynPark, Minnesota. He just sat in the chair and rocked back and forth, the man can't sit still.<P>Our Governor can kick your Governors butt!<BR>And he's good for as few yucks too. What an idiot. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pennockpic.gif"> ||||reg||1
