Z||000030||bHooper||08-29-2001||08:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mbramble:<BR><B>My niece dates some Formula 1 (I think) driver named Eddie Irvine.  She has been introduced to lots of celebs and royalty over the past few months.  I know nothing about racing so I always have to look his name up (by doing a yahoo search for her name) cause I can't remember it!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>of course, you always find a lot of pleasentries associated with his name, don't you?  unfortunatly for your niece, he's about the least liked driver on the circuit.<P>as for myself, i've met several race car drivers; Al Holbert, Bob Holbert (al's dad), and Derek Bell.  A good friend of mine know's Mark Messier's sister.  And a fella that used to sell for me, is related to Bill Guerin.  My dad met some baseball player, Reggie Jackson, I think... and a buddy's father was Musillini's body gaurd.<P>Oh yeah, and I once passed Cathy Lee Crosby in JC Penny's, in florida!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Red</B></FONT></FONT> 86 GT 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><B>Black</B></FONT> <u>86 SE Automatic</u>||||reg||1
