Z||000053||fieronv||08-29-2001||04:38 PM||||When I was in high school a really bad movie was filmed at our house (Blood Song) and I got to meet Frankie Avalon (the killer), Donna Wilkes, aand others. About ten years ago I was part of the ground crew for a non stop around the world ballon attempt (Earthwinds) and I drove Cliff Robertson around in a POS Subaru that I had at the time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I have also met Katherine Bach, Bob Hope, and the guy how played Greg Brady. <P>------------------<BR>85GT (twoloud)||||reg||1
